    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a recipe with its properties and related data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Encapsulates all information related to a single recipe..</para>
<para>Each recipe contains a unique ID, name, category, calorie count, preparation time, a list of ingredients, and preparation instructions. </para>
